[{"answer":"Hello William.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/1.mp3"},{"answer":"This is Amber -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/2.mp3"},{"answer":"you said to phone if I wanted to get more information about the job agency you mentioned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Is now a good time?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hi Amber. Yes. Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/5.mp3"},{"answer":"So the agency I was talking about is called Bankside -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/6.mp3"},{"answer":"they're based in Docklands -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I can tell you the address now - 497 Eastside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/8.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/9.mp3"},{"answer":"So is there anyone in particular I should speak to there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/10.mp3"},{"answer":"The agent I always deal with is called Becky Jamieson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me write that down -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Becky...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Jamieson","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Jamieson","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have her direct line?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's in my contacts somewhere -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/17.mp3"},{"answer":"right, here we are:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/18.mp3"},{"answer":"07866510333.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't call her until the afternoon if I were you -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/20.mp3"},{"answer":"she's always really busy in the morning trying to fill last-minute vacancies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/21.mp3"},{"answer":"She's really helpful and friendly so I'm sure it would be worth getting in touch with her for an informal chat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/22.mp3"},{"answer":"It's mainly clerical and admin jobs they deal with, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/23.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I know you're hoping to find a full-time job in the media eventually -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/25.mp3"},{"answer":"but Becky mostly recruits temporary staff for the finance sector -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/26.mp3"},{"answer":"which will look good on your CV - and generally pays better too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah - I'm just a bit worried because I don't have much office experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't worry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/29.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll probably start you as a receptionist, or something like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/30.mp3"},{"answer":"So what's important for that kind of job isn't so much having business skills or","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/31.mp3"},{"answer":"knowing lots of different computer systems - it's communication that really matters -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/32.mp3"},{"answer":"so you'd be fine there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And you'll pick up office skills really quickly on the job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not that complicated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/35.mp3"},{"answer":"OK good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/36.mp3"},{"answer":"So how long do people generally need temporary staff for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be great if I could get something lasting at least a month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That shouldn't be too difficult.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/39.mp3"},{"answer":"But you're more likely to be offered something for a week at first, which might get extended.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/40.mp3"},{"answer":"It's unusual to be sent somewhere for just a day or two.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Right,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I've heard the pay isn't too bad -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/43.mp3"},{"answer":"better than working in a shop or a restaurant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes - definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/45.mp3"},{"answer":"The hourly rate is about £10, 11 if you're lucky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/46.mp3"},{"answer":"That's pretty good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I was only expecting to get eight or nine pounds an hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you want me to tell you anything about the registration process?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I know you have to have an interview.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/51.mp3"},{"answer":"The interview usually takes about an hour","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and you should arrange that about a week in advance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/53-2023-12-19-17-05-17.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose I should dress smartly if it's for office work -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I can probably borrow a suit from Mum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/56.mp3"},{"answer":"It's better to look too smart than too casual.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Will I need to bring copies of my exam certificates or anything like that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/58.mp3"},{"answer":"No - they don't need to see those, I don't think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/59.mp3"},{"answer":"What about my passport?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes - they will ask to see that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/61.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't get stressed about the interview though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just a chance for them to build relationship with you -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/64.mp3"},{"answer":"so they can try and match you to a job which you'll like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/65.mp3"},{"answer":"So there are questions about personality that they always ask candidates -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/66.mp3"},{"answer":"fairly basic ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/67.mp3"},{"answer":"And they probably won't ask anything too difficult like what your plans are for the future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Hope not.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, there are lots of benefits to using an agency -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/70.mp3"},{"answer":"for example, the interview will be useful because they'll give you feedback on your performance","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/71.mp3"},{"answer":"so you can improve next time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And they'll have access to jobs which aren't advertised.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/74.mp3"},{"answer":"most temporary jobs aren't advertised.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/75.mp3"},{"answer":"And I expect finding a temporary job this way takes a lot less time -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/76.mp3"},{"answer":"it's much easier than ringing up individual companies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes indeed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Well I think...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-1-2023-01-08-23-30-57/79.mp3"}]
